  "状态": "Status",
  "请输入批量选题列表（每行一个），例如：\n为什么越来越多年轻人开始逃离大厂去小县城？\n深度解析三国诸葛亮的北伐战略账本与后勤生死局\n普通人如何用 AI 搭建属于自己的第一套自动化副业？\n为什么你拼命学技能，却赚不到底层认知差的钱？": "Please enter a batch topic list (one per line), e.g.:\nWhy are more young people escaping big tech for small cities?\nDeep strategic analysis of Zhuge Liang's northern expedition logistics.\nHow ordinary creators can build automated AI side hustles.\nWhy hard skills without cognitive frameworks fail to monetize.",
  "在此直接粘贴您在微信公众号、知乎、语雀、Notion 或本地写好的外来文案…\n导入后系统将自动载入专业双栏工作台，您可以随时点击「⚡ AI 一键改写提升」注入名家文风与爆款技能进行深度重构！": "Paste external copy here from WeChat MP, Zhihu, Yuque, Notion or local files...\nSystem will automatically load the dual-column workbench. Click '⚡ AI 1-Click Rewrite Boost' anytime to inject master styles and viral skills for deep restructuring!",
  "点击「全文通读·提取要点」让 AI 分析文章并为每张图生成专属提示词；每张卡片均可独立修改提示词后「AI 重新生成」，或点击「📤 上传替换」用自己的图片替换；点击图片预览可放大查看。": "Click 'Read Full Draft & Extract Key Points' for AI prompt generation per card. Each card can be individually regenerated or replaced via 'Upload & Replace'. Click preview to enlarge.",
  "登录后可直接一键将成文与卡片直发小红书！若选择「暂不登录」，系统将默认继续生成与排版，文案及高清卡片均可自由复制下载，本次创作不再弹窗打扰。": "Log in to publish drafts and cards directly to Xiaohongshu! If you choose 'Skip Login', generation and layout will continue normally, and copy/cards can be copied or downloaded without further popups.",
  "直接输入任意真实场景（如：老街路边摊冒着热气的炒米粉、雨夜车窗倒影、咖啡馆靠窗看书的青年…），AI 自动注入普利策纪实镜头与自然光影": "Enter any authentic scene (e.g., steaming fried noodles at a night market, rainy night window reflections, youth reading by a cafe window...). AI injects Pulitzer-grade documentary lighting and lenses.",
  "统一管理所有矩阵号工作室空间。支持查看空间状态、一键无缝切换、编辑定位属性、及安全的删除清理（内置默认工作室保护与平滑回退机制）。": "Unified management for all matrix studio workspaces. View workspace status, seamless 1-click switching, attribute editing, and safe deletion (with default studio protection and fallback).",
  "直接点击图片可放大预览；点击「📥 插入当前正文」可将图片插入文章；点击「🔄 设为当前配图」可替换当前草稿封面或插图。": "Click image to enlarge preview; click '📥 Insert into Draft' to insert image into body; click '🔄 Set as Image' to replace cover or illustrations.",
  "为 AI 注入专属于您当前账号的声纹指纹与表达边界，所有写作与重写阶段均会自动载入该画像档案，彻底摆脱机械公文腔。": "Injects custom voiceprint and boundaries into AI. All drafting and rewrite stages load this persona profile automatically, eliminating generic corporate tone.",
  "配置驱动各 Agent 的大模型 Key（上游）。对外提供 API 服务请去「控制中心 → API 网关服务」。": "Configure upstream model keys driving agents. To provide external API services, navigate to 'Control Center → API Gateway Service'.",
  "https://api.deepseek.com/v1 或 http://localhost:11434/v1": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1 or http://localhost:11434/v1",
  "为不同的矩阵号（如硬核科技大V、财经洞察、情感夜话）创建独立工作室空间，隔离专属名家文风、号主资产与生产草稿。": "Create isolated studio workspaces for different matrix accounts (e.g. Hardcore Tech, Financial Insights, Night Stories), isolating master styles, assets, and drafts.",
  "https://api.openai.com/v1 或 http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1": "https://api.openai.com/v1 or http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1",
  "：如不做任何修改，系统将 100% 自动继承后台「控制中心」中配置生效的默认模型服务、对话模型与生图引擎。": ": If left unchanged, system inherits 100% of the active default model provider, chat model, and image engine from Control Center.",
  "https://api.deepseek.com 或 http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1": "https://api.deepseek.com or http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1",
  "：一幕坚决保障创作者的品牌自由。系统默认开启高质感品牌水印印记；您随时可以手动一键关闭，绝不强制绑定。": ": YIMU firmly protects creator brand freedom. Premium watermark imprint is enabled by default; you can toggle it off anytime without lock-in.",
  "一步一步工业级流水线：剧本解构 ➔ 分镜规划 ➔ 关键帧批量出图 ➔ 镜头动效合成 ➔ 全剧母带封包。": "Step-by-step industrial pipeline: Script Deconstruction ➔ Storyboard Planning ➔ Batch Keyframes ➔ Shot Motion Synthesis ➔ Master Cut Assembly.",
